    "fileId": 18453,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Ameloblastoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A typical multilocular, scalloped, radiolucent expansile lesion with partial cortication extending from the coronoid notch to the posterior body of the mandible, with cortical perforation and a displaced developing tooth and minor tooth root resorption (plain radiograph).",
    "source": "Esther Lynn Blinderman Childers",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/44/334/18453.jpg",
