    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Odontogenic myxoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Periphery of an odontogenic myxoma showing microscopic cortical perforation. The sparsely cellular myxoid lesion is contained by the periosteum at the top, with permeative spread around residual bone trabecula and into medullary areas.",
    "source": "Edward W. Odell",
