    "chapterId": 334,
    "fileId": 18476,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Odontogenic keratocyst",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A multilocular radiolucency extending from the mid-ramus to the premolar region with minimal expansion of the inferior cortex. There is peripheral cortication and little displacement of the associated teeth, which do not show root resorption (plain radiograph).",
    "source": "Edward W. Odell",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
