    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Odontogenic keratocyst",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Non-inflamed cyst lining, showing a flat basement membrane with palisaded basal cells, a thin epithelium, and a corrugated, parakeratinized refractile luminal surface.",
    "source": "Lester D.R. Thompson",
